senses.gloss:
--the life and duties of a dancing girl; ऊर्वशी suffered for adopting it;
1: M. 6. 1. ३१.
to serve as courtesans in the palace, temples and also those who are prepared to spend money on them. They in turn were to give gifts in days of festivals;
2: Ib. ७०. १९, २८-33.
residence of, plan for.
3: Ib. २५४. २३.
